    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When activated, the Gu creates a colorless breeze that revolves around the user. Lord Sky Crane names that breeze injury wind: it looks light and harmless, but it is extremely terrifying, and he tells Fang Zheng to defend with all his might.",
        "chapters": [
          341
        ],
