        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_lord_sky_crane"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Wherever injury wind blows, ironbeak flying cranes cry out in pain and crash down as if their wings are broken. When it blows on Fang Zheng, the defensive light around his body flickers while he abandons attack and pours primeval essence into defense. Wei Wu Shang stops activating the Gu when his aperture is close to drying up, then concedes the spar.",
        "chapters": [
          341
        ],
